/* 群の 2 層。どちらも左上を原点に拡大・縮小し、見た目は置き場の箱と重なる。--pixel-filter-group は倍率の変化でスタイルの解決の事象を受けるための印（設計書 A-226） */
/* The two group layers; both scale about the top-left so they visually coincide with the host box. --pixel-filter-group marks the element so it receives style resolution on scale changes (design A-226) */
.pixel-filter-group {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    transform-origin: 0 0;
    --pixel-filter-group: 1;
}

.pixel-filter-group__content {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    transform-origin: 0 0;
}

/* 流れに入る形: 中身の大きさで置き場を広げる（変形は layout に効かない） */
/* Flow form: the content sizes the host (transforms do not affect layout) */
.pixel-filter-group--flow {
    position: relative;
    flex-grow: 1;
}

.pixel-filter-group--flow > .pixel-filter-group__content {
    position: relative;
    flex-grow: 1;
}
